{"n": 708, "grade": "L3", "note": "In 'show me a pie chart of the premises grouped by type', the relation @r3 ties the participle 'grouped' to 'a pie chart', but the words put 'grouped by type' right after 'the premises', so it describes the premises, not the chart.", "sop": "@c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"show\" complement=$n1 complement=$n2\n@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"me\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"pie\" head=\"chart\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$n2 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"premises\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"grouped\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"by\" from=$c2 to=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"type\"\n@r3 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$c2"}
